# What must not reach the image, and one entry that is a correctness bug rather than a size one.
#
# `.env*.local` is the important line. Expo loads it during `expo export` — including in
# production mode — and this repo's copy points EXPO_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL at http://localhost:5000.
# Copied into the build context it would beat the build argument, and the panel would ship to
# production compiled against a URL that exists only on a developer's laptop. Every screen would
# fail to load with a connection error, and the built bundle would look completely normal.
.env*.local

node_modules
dist
.expo
.git
.github
web-build

# Editor and OS noise.
.vscode
.idea
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
